#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_House/scripts.inc:18
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_House_Text_WifeWarmingEggInHotSprings"
msgid ""
"My wife's warming an EGG in the hot\n"
"springs. This is what she told me.\p"
"She left two POKéMON with the DAY CARE.\n"
"And they discovered that EGG!$"
msgstr ""
"我太太正在温泉里给一颗蛋保温。\n"
"她是这么跟我说的：\p"
"她把两只宝可梦寄放在寄放屋，\n"
"然后它们那里就发现了那颗蛋！$"

